checks both. The texts say Steam, not Game Mode: Update Steam (was Update Game Mode), Steam artwork… (was
Covers…), In Steam and Available in Steam (was In Game Mode); Big Picture Mode is Steam's name on the desktop, Game
Mode the handheld's session. The introduction links to RPCS3's release notes (the RPCS3 line no longer does) and
its link to the manual is called Wiki. Refresh and the new pills keep the blue left edge only, also under the
mouse, and every choice box is flat with a thin chevron (arrow-down.svg in the package). RPCS3 settings stays, as
a button under the games: RPCS3's own window is still where its settings, the controllers and game updates are
set; the owner decides when it goes. Tests: the pills, the header boxes, the play time, the controller state, the
